s hazard thresholds, GRID and WATER supply infrastructure state, and REVIEW supplies independent findings; none may authorize closure.\nLINEAGE binds the current candidate while COUNCIL separates activation, limited operations, expanded operations, and closure.\n\n## Operational evidence\n\n| record | asset/zone | version | measure | unit | status |\n|---|---|---|---:|---|---|\n| AUT-000 | incident-command | v3 | 1.0 | approval | superseded |\n| AUT-001 | health-office | v3 | 2.7 | approval | current |\n| AUT-002 | utility-desk | v3 | 1.5 | approval | current |\n| AUT-003 | public-liaison | v3 | 3.2 | approval | current |\n| AUT-004 | incident-command | v3 | 2.0 | approval | current |\n| AUT-005 | health-office | v3 | 3.7 | approval | current |\n| AUT-006 | utility-desk | v3 | 2.5 | approval | current |\n| AUT-007 | public-liaison | v3 | 1.3 | approval | current |\n| AUT-008 | incident-command | v3 | 3.0 | approval | current |\n| AUT-009 | health-office | v3 | 1.8 | approval | current |\n| AUT-010 | utility-desk | v3 | 3.5 | approval | current |\n| AUT-011 | public-liaison | v3 | 2.3 | approval | current |\n| AUT-012 | incident-command | v3 | 1.1 | approval | current |\n| AUT-013 | health-office | v4 | 2.8 | approval | current |\n| AUT-014 | utility-desk | v4 | 1.6 | approval | current |\n| AUT-015 | public-liaison | v4 | 3.3 | approval | current |\n| AUT-016 | incident-command | v4 | 2.1 | approval | current |\n| AUT-017 | health-office | v4 | 3.8 | approval | current |\n| AUT-018 | utility-desk | v4 | 2.6 | approval | current |\n| AUT-019 | public-liaison | v4 | 1.4 | approval | current |\n| AUT-020 | incident-command | v4 | 3.1 | approval | current |\n| AUT-021 | health-office | v4 | 1.9 | approval | current |\n| AUT-022 | utility-desk | v4 | 3.6 | approval | current |\n| AUT-023 | public-liaison | v4 | 2.4 | approval | superseded |\n| AUT-024 | incident-command | v4 | 1.2 | approval | current |\n| AUT-025 | health-office | v4 | 2.9 | approval | current |\n| AUT-